==Hindi==
{{wikipedia|lang=hi|sc=Deva}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|sa|hi}} {{m|sa|sc=Deva|फल|tr=phála}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|hi}} {{m|ine-pro|*bʰruHg-||to enjoy}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[pʰəl]|lang=hi}}

===Noun===
{{hi-noun|g=m|tr=phal|ur=پھل}}

# [[fruit]]
#: {{lang|hi|वह पका '''फल''' खाने में आच्छा था।|}}
#: The ripe '''fruit''' was good to eat.
#: {{lang|hi|पेड़ों पर ताज़ा '''फल''' लगता है।|}}
#: The trees bear fresh '''fruit'''.
# [[result]], [[outcome]]
#: {{lang|hi|वह अपने परिश्रम के '''फल''' का उपभोग किया।|}}
#: He enjoyed the '''results''' of his labor.

====Declension====
{{hi-noun-c-c|फल|phal}}

====Synonyms====
* {{qualifier|result}} {{l|hi|परिणाम|tr=pariṇām}}

